{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">这一刻，先前那种贴近耳边的温暖忽然松开了，仿佛熟悉的水流悄悄改变了方向。琴声变得轻而疏淡，音与音之间留出更多空隙，原有的起伏一时失去依托，像悬在半空，迟迟没有落下。那份游移并不慌张，却带着细微的犹疑，仿佛每一次伸展都在试探新的距离。周围的空间似乎变大了，声音也显得更清凉、更遥远。渐渐地，摇荡的感觉从稀薄处重新聚起，琴声终于轻轻落回水面，找到了柔和而连贯的脉动。只是此时的气息已与先前不同，亲密的暖意淡去，一种更透明、更开阔的光感正在浮现。音乐尚未真正安定，却已在轻微的摇晃中，悄然转向另一片明净。</", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-9c4ace0b44fd412b852a2ff7838bf50d", "response_sha256": "43345c9e83536076ced86ff31656b6a8befb8380a861f6321a2e14d045e912cc", "session_handle": "0d90fe6f-6d9f-457d-97f2-70ebe1974ded", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.85, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.681}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 149, "first_assistant_seconds": 31.985, "first_text_seconds": 32.11, "stream_seconds": 40.672, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 142}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observati